<h2>Anil Neerukonda Institute of Technology and Sciences (ANITS)</h2>

<p>
<b>ANITS (Anil Neerukonda Institute of Technology and Sciences)</b> is a premier autonomous engineering college located in <strong>Visakhapatnam, Andhra Pradesh</strong>. It was established in <b>2001</b> by the <u>Anil Neerukonda Educational Society</u>. The college offers quality undergraduate and postgraduate programs and is accredited with <b>NAAC A+</b>.
</p>

